  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Differ Community Power: Rapid solarisation of public buildings in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Differ Community Power, a daughtercompany of Differ AS, has ca 110 off grid health facilities and schools in operation in Malawi. Their main customer is UNICEF Malawi. 

The company wants to look further into the possibilities of electrification of all scholes and health facilities without access (ca 2000 sites) within 3 years. 

This project encompasses thre parallell processes. 
- mapping (feasibility studies)
- service agreement with the Ministry of Health
- financing of the main project throuhg a SPV. Estimated capex: around USD 70-80 million.</narrative>
  </description>
